hadiths[89]{hadithnumber,text}:
"185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo ghulam beche jis ke paas maal ho to us ka maal bae ke liye hai siwae is ke ke khareedar shart lagae.'"
"186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo khajoor beche us ke gabha hone [zeeragi] ke ba'd to us ka phal bae ke liye hai siwae is ke ke khareedar shart lagae.'"
"187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [farmaya]: 'Jo khajoor beche jabke woh gabha ki gayi hon to us ka phal bae ke liye hai siwae is ke ke khareedar shart lagae.'"
"188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ki bae se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho."
"189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ki bae se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho."
"190","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ki bae se mana farmaya yahan tak ke aafat jati rahe. Usman bin Suraqah kehte hain: Main ne Ibn Umar se poocha: Woh kab hota hai? Unhon ne kaha: Surayya [sitare] ke tulu par."
"191","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ki bae se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho; Aap ne bae aur mushtari ko mana farmaya."
"192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ki bae se mana farmaya yahan tak ke tuzhi hon. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, tuzhi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Yahan tak ke surkh hon.' Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Batao agar Allah phal rok le to tum mein se koi apne bhai ka maal kis mein lega?'"
"193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ke phal ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke tuzha hon. Ravi kehte hain: Ya Rasulullah, tuzha kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Yahan tak ke surkh ho.'"
"194","[AI-translation] Isma'il Shaibani (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne jo apni khajoor ke upar tha sau wasaq mein becha: Agar zyada ho to un ke liye, agar kam ho to un par. To main ne Ibn Umar se is ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ko khajoor se bechne [muzabanah] se mana farmaya siwae is ke ke Aap ne araya mein rukhsat di."
"195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ko khajoor se bechne se mana farmaya."
"196","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar kehte hain: Ham ko Zaid bin Sabit ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne araya ki bae mein rukhsat di."
"197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah se mana farmaya; muzabanah phal ko khajoor se bechna hai, siwae is ke ke Aap ne araya mein rukhsat di."
"198","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hathmah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ko khajoor se bechne se mana farmaya siwae is ke ke Aap ne ariyah ki bae mein rukhsat di: Use us ke andaze se khajoor mein becha jae; use us ke ghar wale rutab [taza khajoor] khayen."
"199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se Zaid bin Sabit [Raziyallahu anhum] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ariyah wale ko rukhsat di ke use apne andaze se beche."
"200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne araya ki bae mein paanch wasaq se kam ya paanch wasaq mein rukhsat di. Dawud ko shak hua, unhon ne kaha: Paanch ya paanch se kam."
"201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [paidawar ki] salon wali bae [bai-us-sinin] se mana farmaya, aur afat [jawaih] [ki wajah se qeemat] dalne ka hukm diya."
"202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi riwayat hai. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Sufyan is hadees ko bayan karte aur us mein jawaih dalne ka zikr nahin farmate. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne 'jawaih dalna' zikr nahin kiya; kyunke woh hadees mein nahin; lekin hadees mein jawaih dalne se pehle kalam tha jo mujhe yaad nahin raha; isi liye main use zikr nahin karta tha."
"203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd [bin Abi Waqqas Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke un se do aadmiyon ke bare mein poocha gaya jinhon ne sult [chilke wali gandum] aur jau mein bae ki. To Sa'd ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein do aadmiyon ne khajoor aur rutab mein bae ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya rutab kam hota hai jab khushk ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Ji. To Aap ne us se mana farmaya."
"204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko Khaibar par amil banaya; woh Aap ke paas janeeb [umdah] khajoor laya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Kya Khaibar ki sari khajoor aisi hai?' Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah; ham ek sa ko do sa mein, do sa ko teen mein lete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aisa na karo; jam [ghair umdah mili juli khajoor] ko dirham mein becho, phir dirham se janeeb khareedo.'"
"205","[AI-translation] Zaid Abu Ayyash (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se baiza [umdah gandum] ko sult se [bechne] ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Kaunsi afzal hai? Unhon ne kaha: Baiza. To unhon ne us se mana farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khajoor ko rutab se khareedne ke bare mein poochte suna. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya woh kam hota hai jab khushk ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Ji. To Aap ne us se mana farmaya."
"206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhaqalah aur muzabanah se mana farmaya. Muhaqalah aadmi ka kheti ko sau faraq gandum mein bechna hai. Muzabanah khajoor ke darakht par khajoor ko sau faraq khajoor mein bechna hai."
"207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah se mana farmaya; muzabanah phal ko khajoor mein nap kar bechna hai, angoor ko kishmish mein nap kar bechna hai."
"208","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah aur muhaqalah se mana farmaya. Muzabanah phal ko khajoor mein khareedna hai; muhaqalah kheti ko gandum mein khareedna aur zameen ko gandum mein kiraye par dena hai."
"209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Riba sirf nasiyah [udhar muddat mein izafe] mein hai.'"
"210","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus bin Hadatsan (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Sona chandi se riba hai siwae ha aur ha [dast ba dast]; gandum gandum se riba hai siwae ha aur ha; gandum gandum se riba hai siwae ha aur ha; jau jau se riba hai siwae ha aur ha.'"
"211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen khana rizq dete jis mein kuch [kami] hoti; woh umdah chahte; woh ek sa ko do sa mein lete. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya mujh tak nahin pahuncha jo tum karte ho?!' Ravi kehte hain: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ham ko khana rizq dete hain jis mein kuch hota hai; ham umdah chahte hain; ham ek sa ko do sa mein lete hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Deenar deenar se, dirham dirham se, ek sa khajoor ek sa khajoor se, ek sa jau ek sa jau se; un mein se kisi mein fazal nahin.'"
"212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Deenar deenar se, dirham dirham se; un dono mein fazal nahin.'"
"213","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar ke sath tha; un ke paas sunar aaya aur kaha: Ai Abdir Rahman, main sona banata hun phir us mein se cheez ko us ke wazan se zyada mein bechta hun; us mein apne hath ke kaam ke qadr izafa leta hun. To Abdullah bin Umar ne use us se mana farmaya. Sunar un se sawal dohrata raha jabke Abdullah use mana farmate yahan tak ke masjid ke darwaze ya apni sawari tak pahunche jis par sawar hona chahte the. Phir Abdullah ne kaha: 'Deenar deenar se, dirham dirham se; un dono mein fazal nahin. Yeh hamare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka ham se ehd hai aur hamara tum se ehd hai.' Ahmad ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Yeh ghalat hai."
"214","[AI-translation] Wardan Roomi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Umar se poocha aur kaha: Main zewar banata hun phir use bechta hun; apni ujrat ya apne hath ke kaam ke qadr izafa leta hun. To Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Sona sone se; un dono mein fazal nahin. Yeh hamare sahib ka ham se ehd hai aur hamara tum se ehd hai. Ahmad ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Yani hamare sahib Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) hain."
"215","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne sone ya chandi ka bartan us ke wazan se zyada mein becha. To Abud-Darda ne un se kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aisi se mana farmate suna siwae misl ba misl ke. To Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Main is mein koi harj nahin samajhta. To Abud-Darda ne kaha: Mujhe Mu'awiyah se kaun ma'zoor rakhe ga? Main unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar deta hun jabke woh mujhe apni rae khabar dete hain! Main tumhare sath us zameen mein nahin rahunga jis mein tum ho. Phir Abud-Darda Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae; unhon ne is ka zikr un se kiya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Mu'awiyah ko likha: 'Use misl ba misl, wazan ba wazan ke siwa na becho.'"
"216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sona sone se na becho siwae misl ba misl ke; un mein se ba'z ko ba'z par fazal na do. Chandi chandi se na becho siwae misl ba misl ke; un mein se ba'z ko ba'z par fazal na do. Un mein se koi ghayab ko naqd se na becho.'"
"217","[AI-translation] Malik bin Aus bin Hadatsan Nashri (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use khabar di ke unhon ne sau deenar ka sarf talash kiya; Talhah bin Ubaidullah ne mujhe bulaya; ham ne bahao tae kiya yahan tak ke unhon ne mujh se sarf liya; unhon ne sona liya use apne hath mein ulat palat farmate. Phir unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke mera khazin Ghaba se aae, ya meri khazina aae; shak Muhammad bin Idris (Rahimahullah) ko. Umar bin Khattab sun rahe the; unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum us se juda na ho yahan tak ke tum us se lo. Phir unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sona chandi se riba hai siwae ha aur ha; gandum gandum se riba hai siwae ha aur ha; khajoor khajoor se riba hai siwae ha aur ha; jau jau se riba hai siwae ha aur ha.'"
"218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gandum gandum se, jau jau se, khajoor khajoor se, namak namak se na becho siwae barabar barabar, ain ba ain, hath hath mein. Lekin sona chandi se, chandi sone se, gandum jau se, jau gandum se, khajoor namak se, namak khajoor se hath hath mein jaise chaho becho.' Ravi kehte hain: Un mein se ek ne khajoor ya namak kam farmaya; dusre ne izafa farmaya: 'Jo zyada de ya zyada le us ne riba kiya.'"
"219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek sa khajoor laya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen yeh kahan se mila?' Us ne kaha: Main ne do sa diye aur is mein se ek sa liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tun ne riba kiya; lekin apni khajoor ko saman se becho phir us se [dusri] khareedo.'"
"220","[AI-translation] Abu Nazrah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Abu Sa'id Khudri ke paas baitha tha ke achanak ek aadmi ne mujhe mere peeche se kankocha. Us ne kaha: Un se chandi ko chandi se zyade ke sath [bechne] ke bare mein poocho. To main ne kaha: Yeh mujhe hukm deta hai ke tum se chandi ko chandi se [bechne] ke bare mein poochun. To Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Woh riba hai. Us ne kaha: Un se poocho: Apni rae se kehte hain ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? To main ne kaha: Yeh kehta hai: Un se poocho: Apni rae se kehte hain ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jo hazir hua woh tum ko bayan karta hun: Khajoor wale Aap ke paas umdah khajoor ka ek sa lae. To Aap ne us se farmaya: 'Goya yeh hamari khajoor se umdah hai.' Us ne kaha: Main ne apni khajoor ke do sa diye aur is khajoor ka ek sa liya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tun ne riba kiya?' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, bazaar mein is ka bhao itna itna hai, is ka bhao itna itna hai. Ravi kehte hain: 'To use saman se becho, phir apne saman se jo khajoor chaho khareedo.' Abu Sa'id kehte hain: Khajoor riba hone ki zyada haqdar hai ya chandi."
"221","[AI-translation] Abu Al-Ash'as Shan'ani (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke un ke paas Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein log aae sone chandi ke bartan farokht karte ataa [tankhwah] tak. To Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue aur kaha: 'Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gandum gandum se, khajoor khajoor se, jau jau se, namak namak se bechne se mana farmaya siwae misl ba misl barabar barabar ke. Jo zyada de ya zyada le us ne riba kiya.'"
"222","[AI-translation] Abu Al-Ash'as (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ek ghazwah mein the jin par Mu'awiyah the; ham ne sona chandi paya; Mu'awiyah ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya ke use logon ko un ki ataon mein beche. Ravi kehte hain: To log us mein jaldi karne lage; Ubadah khade hue aur unhen mana farmaya; unhon ne use wapas kiya. To woh aadmi Mu'awiyah ke paas aaya aur un se shikayat ki. To Mu'awiyah khutba dete khade hue aur kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ahadees bayan karte hain jin mein woh Aap par jhoot bolte hain jo ham ne nahin sunin. To Ubadah khade hue aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zaroor bayan karenge agarche Mu'awiyah na-pasand kare. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sona sone se, chandi chandi se, gandum gandum se, jau jau se, khajoor khajoor se, namak namak se na becho siwae misl ba misl barabar barabar hath hath mein ain ba ain.'"
"223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo khana khareede woh use na beche yahan tak ke use poora le [qabza kare].'"
"224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo khana khareede woh use na beche yahan tak ke use qabza kare.'"
"225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein khana khareedte; Aap ham par bhejte jo ham ko hukm deta ke use us jagah se jahan ham ne use khareeda tha dusri jagah muntaqil karen us ke bechne se pehle."
"226","[AI-translation] Taus (Rahimahullah) se Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rahi woh jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, woh khana hai ke becha jae yahan tak ke napa jae. Sufyan kehte hain: Yani qabza kiya jaae. Amr kehte hain: Taus kehte hain: Beshak Ibn Abbas ne apni rae se kaha; main har cheez ko usi jaise samajhta hun."
"227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hakim kehte hain: Main khana khareedta; 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe khana bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke use qabza karun.'"
"228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamil ke hamil [janin ke pet ke janin] ki bae se mana farmaya."
"229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamil ke hamil ki bae se mana farmaya; woh bae thi jo Jahiliyat wale khareedte: Aadmi oont khareedta [udhar par] yahan tak ke oontni jane phir jo us ke pet mein hai jane."
"230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamil ke hamil ki bae se mana farmaya."
"231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do bae aur do libas se mana farmaya. Rahi do bae: Mulamasah aur munabazah. Rahi do libas: Ishtimalus-samma aur ek kapde mein ghot marna jabke us ki sharamgah par us mein se kuch na ho."
"232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mulamasah aur munabazah se mana farmaya."
"233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Do bae karne wale un mein se har ek apne sathi par ikhtiyar rakhta hai jab tak juda na hon, ya un ki bae ikhtiyar par ho. Jab bae ikhtiyar par ho to wajib ho gayi.'"
"234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab do bae karne wale bae se bae karen to un mein se har ek apni bae mein ikhtiyar rakhta hai jab tak juda na hon, ya un ki bae ikhtiyar par ho. Jab ikhtiyar par ho to wajib ho gayi.' Ibn Umar jab aadmi ko bechte aur use ikhtiyar na dete; woh chahte ke use qabool na kare; woh khade hote aur thodi der chalte phir wapas aate."
"235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab do aadmi khareeden to un mein se har ek ikhtiyar rakhta hai jab tak juda na hon siwae ikhtiyar wali bae ke; woh dono sab, ya un mein se ek dusre ko ikhtiyar de. Agar un mein se ek dusre ko ikhtiyar de aur dono us par bae karen to bae wajib ho gayi. Agar dono bae ke ba'd juda hon jabke un mein se ek ne bae nahin chhori to bae wajib ho gayi.'"
"236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Do bae karne wale un mein se har ek apne sathi par ikhtiyar rakhta hai jab tak juda na hon siwae ikhtiyar wali bae ke.'"
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab do bae karne wale ikhtilaf karen to qaul woh hai jo bae ne kaha; khareedar ko ikhtiyar hai.'"
"238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mal dar ka tal matol zulm hai; jab tum mein se kisi ko mal dar par hawala kiya jae to hawala le.'"
"239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad karda ghulam [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bakr [jawan oont] udhar liya; Aap ke paas sadqe ke oont aae. Abu Rafi kehte hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke us aadmi ka bakr ada karun. To main ne Aap se kaha: Main oonton mein siwae khiyar ruba'i [saat saal ke umdah oont] ke nahin pata. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use use de do; logon mein behtareen ada karne mein sab se achche hain.'"
"240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qafilon se [bazaar se bahar] milne na jao.'"
"241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qafilon se bae ke sath milne na jao.'"
"242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aadmi apne bhai ki bae par [sauda par] na beche.'"
