"255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shehri dehati ke liye na beche; logon ko chhoro Allah un mein se ba'z ko ba'z se rizq de.'"
"256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shehri dehati ke liye na beche.'"
"257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Oontniyon aur bakriyon ko bae ke liye [than mein doodh] na roko. Jo us ke ba'd use khareede, woh do nazron ke ikhtiyar mein hai doodh dohne ke ba'd: Agar pasand kare to rakhe; agar na-pasand kare to wapas kare aur ek sa khajoor [ke sath].'"
"258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi riwayat hai; siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: 'Use wapas kare aur ek sa khajoor na samra [gandum].'"
"259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Oontniyon aur bakriyon ko [than mein doodh] na roko. Jo us ke ba'd use khareede, woh do nazron ke ikhtiyar mein hai doodh dohne ke ba'd: Agar pasand kare to rakhe; agar na-pasand kare to wapas kare aur ek sa khajoor [ke sath].'"
"260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Hibban bin Munqiz ke sar mein ma'mumah [dimagh tak] zakhm laga; un ki zaban bhari hui; woh bae mein dhoka khate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke liye farmaya jo woh khareeden us mein woh teen [din] ikhtiyar mein hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kaho: La khilabah [dhoka nahin].' Ibn Umar kehte hain: Main ne unhen kehte suna: 'La khizabah la khizabah.'"
"261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya ke woh bae mein dhoka khata hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Jab bae karo to kaho: La khilabah [dhoka nahin].' To woh aadmi jab bechta to kehta: La khilabah."
"262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar tak pahuncha ke Samurah ne sharab bechi. To unhon ne kaha: Allah Samurah ko halak kare! Kya use maloom nahin ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ne Yahud par la'nat farmai; un par charbiyan haram ki gayin ke unhen khayen; unhon ne unhen pighlaya aur becha.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Jammaluha yani unhon ne unhen pighlaya."
"263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Maqam ke peeche baithe the; Aap ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, ghadi dekha phir hanse, phir farmaya: 'Allah Yahud ko halak kare; un par charbiyan haram ki gayin; unhon ne unhen becha aur un ki qeemat khai. Beshak Allah Azz wa Jall jab kisi qaum par kisi cheez ka khana haram farmata hai to un par us ki qeemat haram farmata hai.'"
"264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khana bechne wale ke paas se guzre; woh Aap ko pasand aaya; Aap ne us mein apna hath dakhil farmaya to woh geela khana tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ham mein se nahin jo ham ko dhoka de.'"
"265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, zinakar aurat ki ujrat [zina ki kamai], aur kahin ki mithai [nazrana] se mana farmaya."
"266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muhayyisah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pachhne lagane ki kamai ke bare mein poocha; Aap ne use us se mana farmaya. Woh Aap se baat karte rahe yahan tak ke farmaya: 'Use apne ghulam ko khilao aur apne pani dhone wale oont ko khilao.'"
"267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muhayyisah Harisi [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pachhne lagane ki kamai ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne use us se mana farmaya. To unhon ne hajat zikr ki; Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke use apne pani dhone wale oonton ko khilayen."
"268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pachhne lagwaye aur pachhne lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di. Agar woh khabees hoti to use na dete."
"269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke un se poocha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pachhne lagwaye? Unhon ne kaha: Ji; Abu Taibah ne Aap ke pachhne lagaye; Aap ne unhen do sa diye aur un ke aaqaon ko hukm diya ke un se un ka mehsul halka karen. Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak behtareen jis se tum ilaj karte ho pachhne lagana aur tumhare bachchon ke liye uzrah [gale ki sozish] se bahri qust hai; unhen ghamez [gala dabane] se azab na do.'"
"270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Taibah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke pachhne lagaye; Aap ne un ke liye ek sa khajoor ka hukm diya, apne ghar walon ko hukm diya ke un se un ka mehsul halka karen."
"271","[AI-translation] Ibn Muhayyisah, Banu Harisah mein se ek (Rahimahullah) se apne walid [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pachhne lagane ki ujrat mein ijazat mangi; Aap ne use us se mana farmaya. Woh poochte aur ijazat mangte rahe yahan tak ke farmaya: 'Us se apne pani dhone wale oont aur apne ghulam ko khilao.'"
"272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se daud lagai; main Aap se aage badh gayi. Jab main bhari hui to main ne Aap se daud lagai; Aap mujh se aage badh gae. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh us ke badle.'"
"273","[AI-translation] Rabah bin Muhammad Ajlani ke walid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik ko Quba mein dekha: 'Unhon ne peshab farmaya, phir apne zakar ko deewar se ponchha, phir wuzu farmaya, apne mozon par masah farmaya, phir Masjid Quba mein dakhil hue aur namaz padhi.'"
